# Sygg's Command, modes 3 and 4: "Target player draws a card" and "Tap target creature. Put a stun counter on it." Bot1 draws a card
# (the Island on top of its library) and taps and stuns Bot2's Ornithopter. On Bot2's next turn the stun counter is removed instead of
# the Ornithopter untapping (CR 122.1d), so it is still tapped with no counter left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Sygg's Command
Island x5
Plains
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sygg's Command.Cast
Bot1.Modes(3; 4)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 1
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = (absent)
